  "question": {
    "text": "<p>In a Young's double slit experiment with light of wavelength <math><mi>λ,</mi></math> the separation of slits is <math><mi>d</mi></math> and distance of screen is <math><mi>D</mi></math> such that <math><mi>D</mi><mo>≫</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>≫</mo><mi>λ</mi></math> . If the Fringe width is <math><mi>β</mi></math> , the distance from point of maximum intensity to the point where intensity falls to half of the maximum intensity on either side is:</p>\r"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
